* German: [[enträtseln]]
{{trans-mid}}
* Italian: {{t|it|risolvere}}, {{t|it|spiegare}}
* Swahili: {{t|sw|mafumbo|xs=Swahili}}
{{trans-bottom}}

===Etymology 2===
From {{etyl|enm}} {{term|riddil|lang=enm}}, ''[[ridelle]]'' "sieve" from {{etyl|ang}} ''[[hriddel]]'' "sieve", alteration of earlier ''[[hridder]]'', ''[[hrider|hrīder]]'' from {{proto|Germanic|hridan|sieve|lang=}}, from {{proto|Germanic|hrid-|to shake|lang=}}, from {{proto|Indo-European|krey-||lang=}}. Akin to {{etyl|de|-}} ''[[Reiter]]'' "sieve", {{etyl|non|-}} ''[[hreinn]]'' "pure, clean", {{etyl|goh|-}} ''[[hreini]]'' "pure, clean", {{etyl|got|-}} ''[[hrains]]'' "clean, pure". More at [[rinse]]

====Noun====
{{en-noun}}

# A [[sieve]].

